<div class="card">
  <h1>로그인</h1>

  <p class="muted">Bio-Pass 이메일·전화(앱) 인증으로 로그인합니다. (scope: email, phone)</p>
  <form method="get" action="/auth/biopass" class="form">
    <label>
      이메일
      <input
        type="email"
        name="email"
        autocomplete="email"
        placeholder="user@example.com"
        required
        autofocus
      >
    </label>
    <label>
      전화번호 <span class="label-optional">(선택, 앱·SMS 인증 시)</span>
      <input type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="+821012345678">
    </label>
    <button type="submit" class="btn primary btn-block">Bio-Pass로 로그인</button>
  </form>
  <% if (typeof bioPassSecretMisconfigured !== "undefined" && bioPassSecretMisconfigured) { %>
    <p class="muted muted-tight warn-hint">
      <code>BIO_PASS_CLIENT_SECRET</code>에 Client ID가 들어가 있습니다.
      bio-pass 앱 상세의 <strong>Client Secret</strong>(<code>secret_</code>로 시작)을 넣고 서버를 재시작하세요.
    </p>
  <% } else if (typeof bioPassConfigured !== "undefined" && !bioPassConfigured) { %>
    <p class="muted muted-tight warn-hint">
      연동 미완료: <code>.env</code>에 <code>BIO_PASS_CLIENT_ID</code>, <code>BIO_PASS_CLIENT_SECRET</code>을
      bio-pass 앱 값으로 설정한 뒤 서버를 재시작하세요.
    </p>
  <% } %>

  <div class="login-divider" role="separator"><span>또는</span></div>
  <p class="muted muted-tight">로컬 데모 계정: <strong>admin</strong> / <strong>admin</strong></p>

  <form method="post" action="/login" class="form">
    <label>
      아이디
      <input type="text" name="username" autocomplete="username" required>
    </label>
    <label>
      비밀번호
      <input type="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password" required>
    </label>
    <button type="submit" class="btn">로컬 계정으로 로그인</button>
  </form>
</div>
